  "description": "Bring warm autumn charm to your creative projects with this Autumn Floral Pattern Digital Paper Set. Featuring a delicate white floral motif on 12 beautiful fall-inspired solid color backgrounds, this collection combines cozy seasonal shades with a clean, timeless repeating pattern.\nThe palette includes burgundy, wine red, rust, burnt orange, golden mustard, peach, warm brown, tan, beige, olive green, deep sage, and muted yellow. These versatile floral digital papers are perfect for seasonal crafts, scrapbooking, invitations, greeting cards, stationery, gift wrapping, fabric-inspired designs, and printable decorations.\nWhat’s Included:\n♡ 12 unique floral pattern digital papers\n♡ 12 × 12 inch square format\n♡ 300 DPI resolution\n♡ High-quality JPG files\n♡ Coordinated autumn color palette\n♡ Seamless-style repeating floral designs\nPerfect For:\n♡ Fall and autumn crafts\n♡ Scrapbooking and junk journals\n♡ Invitations and greeting cards\n♡ Printable stationery and planners\n♡ Gift tags and wrapping paper\n♡ Paper crafts and DIY projects\n♡ Backgrounds for branding and packaging\n♡ Seasonal party decorations\nAdd a cozy seasonal touch to your designs with this versatile autumn floral paper collection. Mix and match the colors to create coordinated projects for fall celebrations, handmade gifts, and everyday creative work.\n♡ Thank you for visiting my shop! I hope you enjoy using these floral digital papers in your creative projects. If you love this collection, please consider adding it to your favorites. Happy creating!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring warm autumn charm to your creative projects with this Autumn Floral Pattern Digital Paper Set. Featuring a delicate white floral motif on 12 beautiful fall-inspired solid color backgrounds, this collection combines cozy seasonal shades with a clean, timeless repeating pattern.</p>\n<p>The palette includes burgundy, wine red, rust, burnt orange, golden mustard, peach, warm brown, tan, beige, olive green, deep sage, and muted yellow. These versatile floral digital papers are perfect for seasonal crafts, scrapbooking, invitations, greeting cards, stationery, gift wrapping, fabric-inspired designs, and printable decorations.</p>\n<p>What’s Included:<br>\n♡ 12 unique floral pattern digital papers<br>\n♡ 12 × 12 inch square format<br>\n♡ 300 DPI resolution<br>\n♡ High-quality JPG files<br>\n♡ Coordinated autumn color palette<br>\n♡ Seamless-style repeating floral designs</p>\n<p>Perfect For:<br>\n♡ Fall and autumn crafts<br>\n♡ Scrapbooking and junk journals<br>\n♡ Invitations and greeting cards<br>\n♡ Printable stationery and planners<br>\n♡ Gift tags and wrapping paper<br>\n♡ Paper crafts and DIY projects<br>\n♡ Backgrounds for branding and packaging<br>\n♡ Seasonal party decorations</p>\n<p>Add a cozy seasonal touch to your designs with this versatile autumn floral paper collection. Mix and match the colors to create coordinated projects for fall celebrations, handmade gifts, and everyday creative work.</p>\n<p>♡ Thank you for visiting my shop! I hope you enjoy using these floral digital papers in your creative projects. If you love this collection, please consider adding it to your favorites. Happy creating!</p>",
